Package: craftgrn
Title: CraftGRN: Integrative ATAC-RNA Framework for Condition-Specific Gene Regulatory Networks
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", , "yaoxiang@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Chunling", "Yi", , "chunling@example.com", role = "aut")
  )
Description: CraftGRN provides a reproducible framework for constructing and comparing gene regulatory networks by integrating bulk ATAC-seq footprinting with matched RNA-seq expression data. It implements context-specific enhancer-gene linking, TF-centric and differential GRN analysis, and benchmarking modules. CraftGRN enables systematic exploration of transcriptional regulation under diverse conditions.
